# React Frontend Template Source Files

These files are used by the Backstage Scaffolder when a developer selects "React Frontend Application" from the Developer Portal. Placeholders are substituted at scaffold time.

Generated outputs:
- React SPA with Vite + TypeScript
- React Query for data fetching
- Storybook for component development (optional)
- Playwright E2E tests (optional)
- Dockerfile, K8s manifests, CI/CD workflow
- Full Terraform module for infrastructure
